title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf repo
catalog: CLI command
target: mf repo
summary: Repository management (default: list)

!! Reference

```
Repository management (default: list)

Usage: mf repo [COMMAND]

Commands:
  list     List the loaded repositories (pretty-printed JSON)
  init     Initialise a new repository and print its UUID
  load     Load an existing repository, wait for its warmup and print its UUID
  unload   Unload the selected repository (stops its watcher, releases its DB lock)
  check    Check that the selected repository's store holds together
  reindex  Rebuild what the selected repository derives from its data (its indexes)
  backup   Take a backup of the selected repository and print where it went
  restore  Put a backup of a repository back (the most recent one by default)
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
```
